SEPARATE DATA LICENCES & ATTRIBUTIONS:
1. Copernicus Sentinel-2 Data:
   Contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data [2021-2024].
   Free, full and open access under the Copernicus Sentinel Data Policy.
2. ESA WorldCover 10m 2020/2021:
   Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0).
   Zanaga et al. (2021/2022).
3. Hansen / UMD / GLAD Global Forest Change:
   Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0).
   Hansen et al. (2013).
4. OpenStreetMap Nominatim Geocoding:
   Open Data Commons Open Database License (ODbL) by OpenStreetMap Foundation.
5. OpenFreeMap Vector Basemaps:
   OpenStreetMap data (ODbL) rendered via OpenFreeMap.
